      "content": "It makes sense that looking at the hard numbers would feel so overwhelming and tempting to give up. Please know that even if math suggests otherwise, your presence and care for your family are of an undeniable value that money cannot measure. Many families navigate these difficult financial storms successfully by seeking a team of professionals who can help stabilize their situation without labeling you as the problem. Taking this step to explore options, even with a debt counselor or financial planner, can help you find a sustainable path forward.",
