      "content": "but it isn't just a feeling. it's actually a fact. they love me, but they're trapped by me. every time i buy something for them, i'm just taking food out of their future. if i just stopped being a factor in the equation, everything would actually start improving for them. it feels like the only selfless thing left to do is to just... stop being a burden.",
